      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see in intel-tdx-module-1.5-abi-spec-348551001.pdf (not the newest one, but still) it says \"Native\" rather than hardcoded to 64 bytes. So would it be better to enforce the bits from cpuid_def rather than just hardcode 0x3F?\n\n(Though I understand it is probably always 64 bytes anyway, so this is probably a very theoretical concern...)",
      "revId": "8d980ea6ec4cf59b7f5a2a1ba5195dbc5b0196d9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
